OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #3.8m health centre set
OL,4,Afor approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new #3.8m healthcare
OL,7,Ffacility in Rutland are set to be given
OL,8,Fthe go-ahead.
OL,10,FRutland County Council's planning
OL,11,Fcommittee is recommended to approve an
OL,12,Fapplication by the authority to build a
OL,13,Fhealth and innovation centre at Oakham
OL,14,FEnterprise Park at a meeting on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FAccording to planning documents, the
OL,18,Ffacility - named the Medi-Tech Centre -
OL,19,Fwould comprise consultation rooms, two
OL,20,Foperating theatres, diagnostic and
OL,21,Frecovery facilities as well as space
OL,22,Ffor healthcare research.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
