OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #3.8m health centre set
OL,4,Afor approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report submitted by the authority
OL,7,Fstates: "The proposal would deliver a
OL,8,Fnew medical facility providing enhanced
OL,9,Fhealthcare provision alongside
OL,10,Fhealthcare-related enterprise, research
OL,11,Fand innovation."
